      "cooked": "<p><strong>Hello Team,</strong></p>\n<p>We are currently facing an issue on our client’s production server.<br>\nAfter creating the Sales Invoice post - Delivery Note, the e-Way Bill and e-Invoice were also successfully generated. However, once everything is completed, the Sales Invoice is unexpectedly reverting back to <strong>Draft</strong> status automatically.</p>\n<p>Could you please guide us on how to resolve this?<br>\nYour support and timely assistance will be highly appreciated.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/8/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-12-03 18-08-58 - Edited\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/8/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241_2_690x242.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-12-03 18-08-58 - Edited\" data-base62-sha1=\"cGe9Cm9eKmL3ECBuKJIWVOvjPl7\" width=\"690\" height=\"242\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/8/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241_2_690x242.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/8/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241_2_1035x363.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/8/58e01a48189481c82f39022ea71eedd841cf1241_2_1380x484.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2025-12-03 18-08-58 - Edited</span><span class=\"informations\">1531×539 73.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
